  <name>Threshold</name>
  <summary>Battery charge threshold controller for Linux laptops</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Threshold provides a graphical interface for setting the
      battery charge threshold on Linux laptops. The charge limit is written
      directly to the EC microcontroller via the msi-ec kernel module and
      persists across reboots.
    </p>
  </description>
  <categories>
    <category>System</category>
    <category>HardwareSettings</category>
  </categories>
